<title>MEXICO: Mexico December preliminary trade surplus $220 mln.</title>
<headline>Mexico December preliminary trade surplus $220 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's preliminary trade surplus for December was $220 million, the Finance Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The country's preliminary trade surplus for the full year of 1996 was $6.292 billion, the ministry added in a statement.</p>
</text>
